## Recovery validation after Change Request revision 1

The automatic revision 1 Change Request validator reported command 4/30, `go test ./... -count=1 -v`, with exit 1. Its attached log is exactly 65,536 bytes and truncated; the validator recorded `failure_class=unknown`. The monolithic command is not counted green, and its failure cause remains unverified.

